{"question_id": "SMK-01", "request_id": "80d618f42bb74f5eaec8ab01749884ed", "trace_id": "8f92e559b890408296b0e92cc0fa6b35", "http_status": 200, "answer": "根据手册内容，SUMMIT 2196 系列泵长期存放时的要求如下：\n\n- 存放环境：应将泵存放在清洁、干燥的地方，并且不要取下管路接头盖。\n- 泵轴转动频率：至少每周用手旋转泵轴一次，以保持轴承上覆有保护油膜或油脂。\n\n如需长期存放，可向 Summit Pump, Inc. 购买专用护理产品。", "citations": [{"citation_id": "cite_1", "document_name": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page": 9, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-5ce75c93c0a1-000-5ce75c93c0a1"}, {"citation_id": "cite_2", "document_name": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page": 12, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-847dedb676cd-000-847dedb676cd"}, {"citation_id": "cite_3", "document_name": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page": 23, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-05fa62ad30d3-000-05fa62ad30d3"}], "refusal": false, "retrieved_chunk_ids": ["cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-5ce75c93c0a1-000-5ce75c93c0a1", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-e8103950065a-000-e8103950065a", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-05fa62ad30d3-000-05fa62ad30d3", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-c667c6669da3-000-c667c6669da3", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-ac65104a0a87-000-ac65104a0a87", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-5e8b5807c2d6-000-5e8b5807c2d6", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-114bea8f37bc-000-114bea8f37bc", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-e0adf1305803-000-e0adf1305803", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-e39749fc478f-000-e39749fc478f", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-2a41f111f816-000-2a41f111f816", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-1693c615d124-000-1693c615d124", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-和关闭-7f491d84dcb4-000-7f491d84dcb4", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-bc9a8faa74b1-000-bc9a8faa74b1", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-和关闭-98af0d342570-000-98af0d342570", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-5d8e22b0294d-000-5d8e22b0294d", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-障诊断-95388e1fa0ac-000-95388e1fa0ac", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-847dedb676cd-000-847dedb676cd", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-f480c35cb40b-000-f480c35cb40b", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--保证-dd1d1d77b0bf-000-dd1d1d77b0bf", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-27aa8c4f9db8-000-27aa8c4f9db8"], "shadow_audit": null, "total_latency": 0.498, "input_tokens": 1201, 