{"question_id": "SMK-02", "request_id": "4c48d3981dc847ccba2ab42daa9cc5e0", "trace_id": "4f788e0e6b494a16a9f555ab2fb466c3", "http_status": 200, "answer": "SUMMIT 2196 泵的润滑要求如下：\n\n1. **轴承润滑方式**：\n   - 可采用润滑脂或润滑油润滑，具体取决于应用条件。\n\n2. **润滑脂润滑**（适用于泵送介质温度为 -60°F 至 350°F）：\n   - 使用 NLGI 2 号稠度的润滑脂。\n   - 推荐润滑脂：雪铁戈 Mystic EP2。\n   - 重新润滑周期：每三个月进行一次。\n   - 温度超过 350°F 时不建议使用润滑脂润滑。\n   - 重新润滑步骤：\n     1. 清洁润滑脂加注接头。\n     2. 拆下轴承架底部的润滑脂排放塞。\n     3. 注入润滑脂，直到新润滑脂从排放孔流出。\n     4. 重新安装润滑脂排放塞。\n\n3. **润滑油润滑**：\n   - 检查频率：每日通过观察窗检查油位。\n   - 正确油位：应位于观察窗中间位置。\n   - 添加润滑油时：\n     - 取下注油孔塞 (113A)，加注至观察窗中间位置后重新安装。\n   - 更换润滑油周期：\n     - 每运行 2000 小时或三个月更换一次。\n     - 若工作环境恶劣，应更频繁更换。\n   - 更换步骤：\n     - 取下注油孔塞 (113A) 和排放塞 (408A)，将旧油排入容器。\n     - 检查排出油是否含有过多污染物或水分。\n     - 重新安装排放塞，加入新油至观察窗中间位置，再装回注油孔塞。\n   - 推荐润滑油：\n     - 美孚：合成 624、525、626、627\n     - 飞利浦：Magnus 32、46、68、100\n     - 合成 Syndustrial 油雾 100\n\n4. **注意事项**：\n   - 润滑油过多或过少都会导致轴承损坏。\n   - 若润滑油浑浊或受污染，应立即更换。\n\n以上内容依据《SUMMIT PUMP 2196 / 2196-LF / 2196-R / 2796 型安装、操作及维护手册》第15–16页。", "citations": [{"citation_id": "cite_1", "document_name": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page": 16, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-e39749fc478f-000-e39749fc478f"}, {"citation_id": "cite_2", "document_name": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page": 15, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-38cc6dafdf6c-000-38cc6dafdf6c"}, {"citation_id": "cite_3", "document_name": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page": 11, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-114bea8f37bc-000-114bea8f37bc"}], "refusal": false, "retrieved_chunk_ids": ["cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-e39749fc478f-000-e39749fc478f", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-和关闭-84d31a6bae34-000-84d31a6bae34", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-05fa62ad30d3-000-05fa62ad30d3", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-时存放-2c2d77b40d00-000-2c2d77b40d00", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-114bea8f37bc-000-114bea8f37bc", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-购备件-b7cbf0f20048-000-b7cbf0f20048", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-8a9134f69b7a-000-8a9134f69b7a", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-卸泵组-77a0e4311ec5-000-77a0e4311ec5", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-5d8e22b0294d-000-5d8e22b0294d", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-障诊断-95388e1fa0ac-000-95388e1fa0ac", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-ac65104a0a87-000-ac65104a0a87", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-时存放-16847aea2304-000-16847aea2304", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-38cc6dafdf6c-000-38cc6dafdf6c", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-bc9a8faa74b1-000-bc9a8faa74b1", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-847dedb676cd-000-847dedb676cd", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-f14509fdd142-000-f14509fdd142", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-d1faf220e6f2-000-d1faf220e6f2", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-6b59e1a95c3b-000-6b59e1a95c3b", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-1693c615d124-000-1693c615d124", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-05e5a8a76b70-000-05e5a8a76b70"], "shadow_audit": null, "total_latency": 0.441, "input_tokens": 1579, "output_tokens": 539, "total_tokens": 2118, "cache_hit": true, "error": null, "stage": "smoke", "requested_model": "qwen-plus-2025-07-28", "configured_model": "qwen-plus-2025-07-28", "provider_reported_model": null, "provider_reported_model_available": false, "fallback_enabled": false, "fallback_detected": false, "actual_model": "qwen-plus-2025-07-28"}
{"question_id": "SMK-03", "request_id": "d50c09cf5aad41d78c0bb4a0ee022f34", "trace_id": "c08144361f7b45b495d5e6451552d2b4", "http_status": 200, "answer": "入口管路应选择至少比泵的法兰大一个尺码的管道，并通过偏心异径管接头与泵连接。偏心异径管接头应将平面朝上安装。弯管与入口法兰之间的距离应至少为十倍管径。此外，所有管路必须单独支撑，并与泵的入口法兰准确对正，不得强行对正。在与泵法兰直接相连的接头处，建议安装一小段软短管或波纹式短管。（依据：2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf，第10页）", "citations": [{"citation_id": "cite_1", "document_name": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page": 10, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-c99ee01e2d93-000-c99ee01e2d93"}, {"citation_id": "cite_2", "document_name": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page": 10, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-a54d12ed5177-000-a54d12ed5177"}, {"citation_id": "cite_3", "document_name": "t1739cn.pdf", "page": 23, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--安装-649a484b68a5-000-649a484b68a5"}], "refusal": false, "retrieved_chunk_ids": ["cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-a54d12ed5177-000-a54d12ed5177", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-和关闭-2020c244c35a-000-2020c244c35a", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-60f631632134-000-60f631632134", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-和关闭-2a44c976502c-000-2a44c976502c", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--安装-a852e8dcc150-000-a852e8dcc150", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-障诊断-eaae8ad09128-000-eaae8ad09128", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--安装-c79b53d407c9-000-c79b53d407c9", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--安装-2f479eae20bf-000-2f479eae20bf", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--安装-649a484b68a5-000-649a484b68a5", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--安装-4c0decacc13b-000-4c0decacc13b", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--安装-23fbf21e5cf5-000-23fbf21e5cf5", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-c99ee01e2d93-000-c99ee01e2d93", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--安装-cc20e38cbf4c-000-cc20e38cbf4c", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-8b9db897dbdf-000-8b9db897dbdf", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-214f91586a2b-000-214f91586a2b", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-6bbb16843e56-000-6bbb16843e56", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-f237dc8516fe-000-f237dc8516fe", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-450f03b02d3c-000-450f03b02d3c", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-0ee0e4b87829-000-0ee0e4b87829", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--安装-b60720ed33c2-000-b60720ed33c2"], "shadow_audit": null, "total_latency": 0.397, "input_token