{"question_id": "SMK-04", "request_id": "727c95dd88d44c378dbf304c73ed9064", "trace_id": "95ead62094184b60bbf31099a3d2a8d2", "http_status": 200, "answer": "泵不输送液体时可能的原因包括：\n\n- 泵没有灌注。\n- 旋转方向不正确。\n- 叶轮卡塞。\n- 入口管路堵塞。\n\n以上信息来源于《安装、操作及维护手册》（文件名：2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf，页码：23）。", "citations": [{"citation_id": "cite_1", "document_name": "t1739cn.pdf", "page": 37, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-障诊断-07d5c9ba07e1-000-07d5c9ba07e1"}, {"citation_id": "cite_2", "document_name": "t1739cn.pdf", "page": 35, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-和关闭-0cdb66a95926-000-0cdb66a95926"}, {"citation_id": "cite_3", "document_name": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page": 23, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-05fa62ad30d3-000-05fa62ad30d3"}], "refusal": false, "retrieved_chunk_ids": ["cchunk-pymupdf-v1-障诊断-edddb0cca40c-000-edddb0cca40c", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-障诊断-408b57771ee4-000-408b57771ee4", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-障诊断-95388e1fa0ac-000-95388e1fa0ac", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-0f44c075b8e8-000-0f44c075b8e8", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-障诊断-6af6a3e6aaa8-000-6af6a3e6aaa8", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-d913d9c15acb-000-d913d9c15acb", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-障诊断-07d5c9ba07e1-000-07d5c9ba07e1", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-05fa62ad30d3-000-05fa62ad30d3", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-f14509fdd142-000-f14509fdd142", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-ce631c176fb5-000-ce631c176fb5", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-障诊断-30658010fdb2-000-30658010fdb2", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-障诊断-a6217f0db196-000-a6217f0db196", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-障诊断-150d65b3f4c3-000-150d65b3f4c3", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-和关闭-0cdb66a95926-000-0cdb66a95926", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-和关闭-db01d9f3b0b4-000-db01d9f3b0b4", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-和关闭-2fc3d4695355-000-2fc3d4695355", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-障诊断-bb57c904b763-000-bb57c904b763", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-和关闭-2020c244c35a-000-2020c244c35a", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--安全-21ccbc8db89c-000-21ccbc8db89c", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-450f03b02d3c-000-450f03b02d3c"], "shadow_audit": null, "total_latency": 0.423, "input_tokens": 1448, "output_tokens": 72, "total_tokens": 1520, "cache_hit": true, "error": null, "stage": "smoke", "requested_model": "qwen-plus-2025-07-28", "configured_model": "qwen-plus-2025-07-28", "provider_reported_model": null, "provider_reported_model_available": false, "fallback_enabled": false, "fallback_detected": false, "actual_model": "qwen-plus-2025-07-28"}
{"question_id": "SMK-05", "request_id": "57367d4cef934e6a9cd329d7ed55a03d", "trace_id": "a0cd45d96bc049f288b4b87faed5ee98", "http_status": 200, "answer": "启动泵前的安全要求包括：\n\n1. 确保泵组已正确连接到电源，并配备所有保护装置。\n2. 水泵必须充注待处理液体，并完成排气。\n3. 检查旋转方向是否正确。\n4. 所有必要的辅助接口应已完成连接并处于正常工作状态。\n5. 如果电机需要润滑，应在启动前按电机手册对电机轴承进行润滑（水泵轴承在出厂时已完全润滑，运行至第8章再润滑表格规定的运行时数前无需重新润滑）。\n6. 泵轴应能自由转动，无刺耳噪声。\n7. 泵壳和吸入管路必须充满液体。\n8. 系统管道已经清洗。\n9. 水泵、吸入管路和进水箱（如有配置）都已进行排气并充注待泵送液体。\n10. 注液和排气管路在启动前应关闭。\n11. 严禁在未注液的情况下启动泵组（禁止干运行）。\n12. 启动时排出侧截断装置应略微或完全打开，禁止在吸入和/或排出管路截断装置关闭的情况下运行水泵。\n\n以上内容依据《t1739cn.pdf》第28、30、31页内容整理。", "citations": [{"citation_id": "cite_1", "document_name": "t1739cn.pdf", "page": 30, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-和关闭-2020c244c35a-000-2020c244c35a"}, {"citation_id": "cite_2", "document_name": "t1739cn.pdf", "page": 31, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-和关闭-84d31a6bae34-000-84d31a6bae34"}, {"citation_id": "cite_3", "document_name": "t1739cn.pdf", "page": 28, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-和关闭-2a44c976502c-000-2a44c976502c"}], "refusal": false, "retrieved_chunk_ids": ["cchunk-pymupdf-v1--安全-8f3fc46039ec-000-8f3fc46039ec", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-2ecc4dee4a81-000-2ecc4dee4a81", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-和关闭-2020c244c35a-000-2020c244c35a", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--安装-73e13cfb6828-000-73e13cfb6828", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-和关闭-84d31a6bae34-000-84d31a6bae34", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-和关闭-2a44c976502c-000-2a44c976502c", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-ee5b7934fd50-000-ee5b7934fd50", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--安全-ed3404cdde15-000-ed3404cdde15", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-术规格-8feed9ec71ae-000-8feed9ec71ae", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--安全-6a66fa385311-000-6a66fa385311", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-和关闭-db01d9f3b0b4-000-db01d9f3b0b4", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-a54d12ed5177-000-a54d12ed5177", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-和关闭-abc00ad64f98-000-abc00ad64f98", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-5e8b5807c2d6-000-5e8b5807c2d6", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--安全-d3bb3f5f715b-000-d3bb3f5f715b", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-f480c35cb40b-000-f480c35cb40b", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--安全-21ccbc8db89c-000-21ccbc8db89c", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-体说明-339be7457d7e-000-339be7457d7e", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-d1faf220e6f2-000-d1faf220e6f2", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-c2f516683a2b-000-c2f516683a2b"], "shadow_audit": null, "total_latency": 0.493, "input_tokens": 1618, "output_tokens": 277, "total_tokens": 1895, "cache_hit": true, "error": null, "stage": "smoke", "requested_model": "qwen-plus-2025-07-28", "configured_model": "qwen-plus-2025-07-28", "provider_reported_model": null, "provider_reported_model_available": false, "fallback_enabled": false, "fallback_detected": false, "actual_model": "qwen-plus-2025-07-28"}
